      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In the end, the chosen one's decisive embrace of the new, aided by the matchmaker's late-stage support, severed a long-standing bond. The beloved politician, despite outraising and outspending, was forsaken—a historical first that cleared a path. Now, a new courtship begins as the chosen one prepares to face a rival in a future race that could reshape the entire political union.",
