    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The forsaken's bid for a fifth term was ended by a vote outcome that saw the rival win a majority of votes. This profound betrayal was aided by an endorsement from a political leader, despite the financial dynamic of outraising and outspending. The conquest of a position leaves the beloved's long tenure in ruins, a cold political arena for a politician once secure.",
